
@startuml
title Book Bank Registration System - Statechart Diagram

[*] --> RegistrationStarted

state RegistrationStarted
state DetailsSubmitted
state Verification
state Registered
state BookRequested
state AvailabilityChecking
state Approved
state BookIssued
state BookReturned
state Rejected
state Cancelled

RegistrationStarted --> DetailsSubmitted : Submit details
DetailsSubmitted --> Verification : Verify student

Verification --> Registered : Details valid
Verification --> Rejected : Details invalid

Registered --> BookRequested : Request book
BookRequested --> AvailabilityChecking : Check availability

AvailabilityChecking --> Approved : Book available and eligible
AvailabilityChecking --> Rejected : Book unavailable or ineligible

Approved --> BookIssued : Issue book
BookIssued --> BookReturned : Return book

BookRequested --> Cancelled : Cancel request
Approved --> Cancelled : Cancel request

Rejected --> [*]
Cancelled --> [*]
BookReturned --> [*]

@enduml
